        "title": "feat: add bridge rich links",
        "body": "## Summary\n- add `send-rich --url <url> --rich-link` for bridge-backed URL preview balloon sends\n- forward RPC `send.rich` params `url` + `rich_link: true` into the bridge\n- generalize helper balloon-message construction and archive `LPLinkMetadata` for `com.apple.messages.URLBalloonProvider` payloads\n- fix queued CLI/RPC identity resolution so URL-only rich-link sends resolve using the effective URL text\n- remove the release-owned changelog edit; release-note context stays in this PR body\n\n## Redacted runtime proof on lobster\nProof collected on lobster with branch-local artifacts from `feat/rich-links` and a freshly relaunched SIP-disabled injected Messages.app session. Raw logs stay local because they include chat GUIDs, message GUIDs, row IDs, and local identifiers.\n\n- branch head after review/CI fixes: `fdd7484`\n- runtime proof directory: `/Users/lobster/imsg-pr-proofs/2026-07-08/165-rich-links/bridge-run-20260708-213156`\n- visual proof: `/Users/lobster/imsg-pr-proofs/2026-07-08/165-rich-links/bridge-run-20260708-213156/visual/messages-rich-link-proof.png`\n- source screenshot supplied by user: `/Users/lobster/GitHub/imsg/.orca/drops/Snapzy_2026-07-08_21-32-19_007.png`\n- test chat: `Lobster Test Group` (chat row 22; GUID redacted in PR text)\n- status proof: `imsg status --json` reported SIP disabled, bridge v2 ready, and `send.rich` available\n- before/scope: existing `main` did not expose `--url ... --rich-link` rich URL preview sends\n- code-fix proof: queued CLI and RPC URL-only rich-link tests now assert `MessageSendOptions.text == \"https://imsg.sh\"` so sent-message lookup uses the URL instead of empty text\n- plain bridge URL run: `send-rich --text https://imsg.sh --json` exited 0 and returned queued row/guid fields\n- rich-link run: `send-rich --url https://imsg.sh --rich-link --json` exited 0 and returned queued row/guid fields, including resolved `guid`, `message_id`, `messageGuid`, and row `id`\n- history readback: rows immediately after the marker contain the plain URL and rich-link URL sends with distinct message GUIDs\n- visual confirmation: Messages.app showed the marker `PR165 bridge proof 20260708-213156` followed by two rendered `imsg.sh` URL preview cards; the second card corresponds to the rich-link command\n\nNote: a first attempt to use the standard AppleScript `imsg send` path for the plain URL comparison timed out in Messages.app (`AppleEvent timed out`). The completed proof therefore compares bridge plain URL text send vs bridge `--rich-link` URL send in the same chat/session.\n\n## Verification\n- `make build` ✅ on lobster for `fdd7484`\n- `swift format lint --recursive Sources Tests TestsLinux` ✅\n- `git diff --check` ✅\n- `make lint` ⚠️ blocked after swift-format by local SwiftLint/SourceKit crash: `Loading sourcekitdInProc.framework/Versions/A/sourcekitdInProc failed`\n- `make test` ⚠️ blocked before project tests run on this host: `Tests/IMsgCoreTests/BridgeHelperLocatorTests.swift:2:8: error: no such module 'Testing'`\n- GitHub CI ✅ for `fdd7484`; previous head `b9d014a` had a macOS test compile failure from a helper-test dependency, now made self-contained\n\n\n",
